# 提交被拒后重新克隆工作目录也失败：工作目录保持「已污染」，同一次存盘的下一个提交（共享箱）照样拒绝并再克隆一次（这回成），下一次存盘两边都提交；已提交版本一直合法
# Re-cloning the work directory after a refused commit fails too: the work directory stays tainted, the next commit of the same save (the shared stash) is refused again and re-clones (this time it works), and the next save commits both sides; the committed version stays valid throughout
name reclone_fails
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
fault arm guestopen
fault arm reclone
save_now wait=0
expect save result=rejected timeout=10
expect save result=rejected timeout=10
expect_state save_mounted=0 timeout=10
sleep 1
save_now timeout=8
quit
check event fault point=guestopen
check event fault point=reclone
check event save_alert
check no_event save_stuck
check saved
